            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Xz package contains programs for compressing and decompressing files. It provides capabilities for the lzma and the newer xz compression formats. Compressing text files with"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "xz"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "yields a better compression percentage than with the traditional"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "gzip"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "or"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "bzip2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "commands."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
